1:29.90,0:01:34.91,English - OP18,,0,0,0,,and keep on going through the hard knock days.Dialogue: 1,0:01:29.91,0:01:31.67,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,sDialogue: 2,0:01:29.99,0:01:30.43,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,suDialogue: 2,0:01:30.13,0:01:30.67,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,suDialogue: 2,0:01:30.37,0:01:30.84,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,muDialogue: 2,0:01:30.54,0:01:31.06,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,beDialogue: 2,0:01:30.76,0:01:31.31,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,kiDialogue: 2,0:01:31.01,0:01:31.67,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,hardDialogue: 2,0:01:31.37,0:01:32.07,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,knockDialogue: 2,0:01:31.67,0:01:34.83,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,daysDialogue: 0,0:01:42.70,0:01:44.68,Title,,0,0,240,,Cora-sanDialogue: 0,0:01:49.54,0:01:54.05,Captions,,0,0,0,,Corazón and the Donquixote Family's Rendezvous Point Swallow IslandDialogue: 0,0:01:54.74,0:01:58.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't let your guard down. Our enemy is Doflamingo.Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.94,0:02:00.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Sengoku, that fool...Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.91,0:02:06.13,Captions,,0,0,0,,Navy HQ Vice Admiral TsuruDialogue: 0,0:02:02.98,0:02:06.14,Main,,0,0,3,,Just where did he get this kind of information?Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.54,0:02:08.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Vice Admiral Tsuru!Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.01,0:02:08.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Hmm?Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.08,0:02:11.51,Main,,0,0,0,,We got a call from the scout ship at Minion Island!Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.25,0:02:20.01,Captions,,0,0,0,,The Island where the pirate Barrels is hiding Minion IslandDialogue: 0,0:02:17.84,0:02:20.28,Main,,0,0,3,,Barrels' hideout is on fire?Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.28,0:02:23.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes! We're sending men to investigate.Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.04,0:02:24.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Idiot!Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.22,0:02:28.23,Main,,0,0,0,,If they see you, the deal will be off!Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.90,0:02:33.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Check the coastal area now and report back if you spot anyone suspicious.Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.23,0:02:34.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am!Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.58,0:02:44.49,Captions,,0,0,0,,Ghost Town The Pirates' HideoutDialogue: 0,0:02:41.70,0:02:43.86,Main,,0,0,3,,Hurry up and put out the fire!Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.84,0:02:48.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Captain Barrels!Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.34,0:02:50.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Hang in there!Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.84,0:02:52.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Move it!Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.02,0:02:56.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Forget about my wounds!Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.20,0:03:00.36,Main,,0,0,0,,It's a five billion belly deal!Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.90,0:03:04.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Get the Operation Fruit back!Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.08,0:03:10.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Cora-san...Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.04,0:03:14.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Good. You're okay.Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.40,0:03:16.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Silent.Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.02,0:03:20.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Look!Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.52,0:03:23.11,Main,,0,0,0,,It's the Operation Fruit!Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.74,0:03:29.70,Main,,0,0,0,,The building is on fire, and I heard some gunshots...Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.70,0:03:32.60,Main,,0,0,0,,so I thought maybe something happened to you...Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.60,0:03:35.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! That's beside the point!Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.08,0:03:38.25,Main,,0,0,0,,You gotta celebrate!Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.25,0:03:41.16,Main,,0,0,0,,This Devil Fruit will save your life!Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.16,0:03:45.14,Main,,0,0,0,,But even if I eat it, you don't know...Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.80,0:03:47.41,Main,,0,0,0,,if it will cure my disease...Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.40,0:03:52.29,Main,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?! It will!Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.29,0:03:54.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, eat it! Here! Eat it quickly!Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.66,0:03:54.86,Main,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?!Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.80,0:03:57.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Gross!Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.48,0:04:01.02,Main,,0,0,0,,There! Chew it like this!Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.56,0:04:03.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Chew it up and swallow it down!Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.44,0:04:24.80,Main,,0,0,0,,H-Hey, Cora-san! I wasn't ready to become a Devil Fruit user...Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.44,0:04:29.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Cora-san?Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.94,0:04:31.40,Main,,0,0,0,,H-Hey!Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.40,0:04:32.58,Main,,0,0,0,,This is enough.Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.94,0:04:37.70,Main,,0,0,0,,You can... cure yourself now...Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.08,0:04:42.76,Main,,0,0,0,,We've outsmarted Doflamingo... We won...Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.52,0:04:45.71,Main,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Cora-san?Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.71,0:04:47.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you tired?Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.00,0:04:50.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute!Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.90,0:05:00.12,Main,,0,0,0,,You're covered in blood!Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.20,0:05:03.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Cora-san, did you get shot?!Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.80,0:05:07.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I made a little blunder...Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.20,0:05:09.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn! What are you doing, Cora-san?!Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.97,0:05:10.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.80,0:05:13.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Get better! Get better!Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.90,0:05:17.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Get better!Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.48,0:05:22.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop, blood! Stop!Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.07,0:05:25.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Operation power! Heal him!Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.64,0:05:25.68,Main,,0,0,0,,You fool...Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.12,0:05:29.71,Main,,0,0,0,,I told you the ability doesn't work like magic.Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.20,0:05:32.48,Main,,0,0,0,,What am I supposed to do, then?!Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.48,0:05:35.64,Main,,0,0,0,,You... got shot because of me, right?!Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.16,0:05:39.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Law... I'll be alright.Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.90,0:05:42.78,Main,,0,0,0,,These wounds won't kill me...Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.46,0:05:44.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Cora-san!Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.46,0:05:48.56,Main,,0,0,0,,But I want to stop the bleeding for a while...Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.54,0:05:50.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Listen carefully, Law.Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.66,0:05:55.59,Main,,0,0,0,,We succeeded in stealing the Operation Fruit.Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.48,0:06:00.92,Main,,0,0,0,,But Doffy will still come for us.Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.44,0:06:05.86,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry to use you when you're weakened, but I need you to do me a favor.Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.58,0:06:12.48,Main,,0,0,0,,There's a Navy scout ship off the west coast of the island...Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.22,0:06:16.08,Main,,0,0,0,,I want you to hand this over to them...Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.78,0:06:21.50,Main,,0,0,0,,All of the marines will know what it is once they see this cylinder.Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.00,0:06:25.42,Main,,0,0,0,,This small package will save...Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.42,0:06:28.34,Main,,0,0,0,,a far-off kingdom called Dressrosa.Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.34,0:06:29.54,Main,,0,0,0,,A kingdom?Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.36,0:06:33.23,Main,,0,0,0,,But I hate the Navy...Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.23,0:06:35.17,Main,,0,0,0,,You're the son of a doctor, aren't you?Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.56,0:06:40.24,Main,,0,0,0,,As soon as you finish delivering this, let's get off of this island!Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.18,0:06:48.35,Main,,0,0,0,,And let's travel all around the world, just you and I.Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.88,0:06:58.66,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,The marines...Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.52,0:07:05.64,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,He's all by himself!Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.60,0:07:09.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, take this!Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.22,0:07:13.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, it must be a secret letter.Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.34,0:07:16.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Someone asked you to give me this, right?Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.62,0:07:17.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you.Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.62,0:07:23.88,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll keep it. Don't worry.Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.68,0:07:28.01,Main,,0,0,0,,By the way, little boy, you sound so weak...Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.08,0:07:32.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Can I... trust you?Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.74,0:07:37.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, if you're talking about the letter, I'll take responsibility and...Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.61,0:07:39.72,Main,,0,0,0,,I need you to help someone!Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.96,0:07:43.81,Main,,0,0,0,,H-He got shot and he's dying!Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.32,0:07:46.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Please! Save him!Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.06,0:07:50.72,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't want him to die!Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.58,0:07:56.04,Main,,0,0,0,,He got shot... because of me!Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.18,0:08:06.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Cora-san!Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.30,0:08:10.17,Main,,0,0,0,,He said he's gonna give you first aid!Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.00,0:08:15.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Cora-san!Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.66,0:08:17.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Vergo!Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.58,0:08:20.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Corazón?! What are you doing here?!Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.53,0:08:21.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh? Did you just talk?!Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.30,0:08:25.42,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Oh no! Don't tell me his secret mission is...Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.18,0:08:32.52,Main,,0,0,0,,You two know each other?Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.14,0:08:35.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Vergo... Wait...Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.70,0:08:37.70,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Vergo?Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.12,0:08:42.43,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,A strong member of the Family, who's currently working alone on a secret mission of some sort.Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.34,0:08:46.57,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,The details of the mission were kept secret from even the Family.Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.57,0:08:49.13,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,He has nothing to do with you.Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.76,0:09:01.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't! That's...Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.98,0:09:08.46,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,So Vergo's mission is to infiltrate the Navy!Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.04,0:09:10.62,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Curse my luck!Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.98,0:09:15.83,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,There are thousands of marines and of all of them, he got the letter!Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.42,0:09:20.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Understood, Rosinante!Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.12,0:09:22.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Give it back!Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.01,0:09:27.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Cora-san!Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.02,0:09:29.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Cora-san!Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.39,0:09:35.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Rosinante!Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.76,0:09:36.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop it!Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.92,0:09:40.60,Main,,0,0,0,,You... You bastard!Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.60,0:09:42.74,Main,,0,0,0,,You! You-You! You!Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.60,0:09:45.83,Main,,0,0,0,,You're that Vergo guy?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.00,0:09:50.87,Main,,0,0,0,,"That Vergo guy"?Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.30,0:09:55.26,Main,,0,0,0,,So I guess you're Law from the White Town.Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.04,0:10:00.75,Main,,0,0,0,,I heard about you. I heard you two went missing.Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.58,0:10:04.16,Main,,0,0,0,,You have no sense of propriety.Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.66,0:10:07.35,Main,,0,0,0,,If you know that I'm your superior...Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.76,0:10:09.28,Main,,0,0,0,,It's "Vergo-san" to you!Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.00,0:10:16.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Law!Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.44,0:10:20.49,Main,,0,0,0,,There's quite a bit of info in here.Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.49,0:10:25.17,Main,,0,0,0,,If the Navy got this kind of letter, that'd be it for the Family!Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.56,0:10:28.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Our future plans would all be ruined.Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.74,0:10:33.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Is the kid more important to you than the Family...Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.56,0:10:37.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Second Corazón?!Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.96,0:10:45.62,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't believe we had a rat like you in our Family!Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.58,0:10:56.82,Main,,0,0,0,,You went missing one day when you were eight.Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.82,0:11:01.92,Main,,0,0,0,,And then you returned fourteen years later!Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.92,0:11:03.71,Main,,0,0,0,,It was enough to be skeptical about you!Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.20,0:11:09.05,Main,,0,0,0,,But just because you're his brother, Doffy trusted you!Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.44,0:11:10.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Rosinante!Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.40,0:11:23.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Please stop... Cora-san... He's gonna die!Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.80,0:11:45.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Whoa-whoa, you haven't killed them, have you?Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.32,0:11:50.18,Main,,0,0,0,,So what's the situation?Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.56,0:11:53.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Corazón was the Navy's spy.Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.09,0:11:55.76,Main,,0,0,0,,He was with the Family in order to take you down.Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.98,0:12:00.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Be careful. They must know all of your plans.Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.34,0:12:02.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Where are you now, Doffy?Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.44,0:12:10.09,Main,,0,0,0,,I was watching the rendezvous spot, Swallow Island, when two warships came.Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.09,0:12:13.44,Main,,0,0,0,,That was enough to convince even me...Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.44,0:12:17.65,Main,,0,0,0,,That my dear younger brother has bared his fangs at me.Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.28,0:12:21.33,Main,,0,0,0,,And it reminded me...Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.08,0:12:24.26,Main,,0,0,0,,That you guys...Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.74,0:12:26.32,Main,,0,0,0,,are the only family I have!Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.70,0:12:30.66,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sad to say, my hunch was correct.Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.62,0:12:35.27,Main,,0,0,0,,We just landed at Minion Island where you guys are.Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.80,0:12:39.14,Main,,0,0,0,,But it was a bit too late...Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.82,0:12:45.81,Main,,0,0,0,,We arrived and saw Barrels' underlings running around saying the Devil Fruit got stolen.Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.16,0:12:47.76,Main,,0,0,0,,It must have been Corazón!Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.10,0:12:52.73,Main,,0,0,0,,If he's there, don't let him go anywhere! He has the Operation Fruit!Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.73,0:12:54.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I got...Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.62,0:12:55.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn them!Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.42,0:12:58.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, did they run?Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.66,0:13:00.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, no worries.Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.38,0:13:05.70,Main,,0,0,0,,As long as they're in the town...Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.58,0:13:08.98,Main,,0,0,0,,I won't let them get away.Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.32,0:13:24.22,Main,,0,0,0,,What's that?! Something's coming down!Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.54,0:13:25.62,Main,,0,0,0,,What the hell?!Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.80,0:13:28.59,Main,,0,0,0,,What's happening on this island?!Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.36,0:13:33.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Ouch!Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.96,0:13:36.76,Main,,0,0,0,,These strings are sharp!Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.76,0:13:38.49,Main,,0,0,0,,They're hard, too!Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.49,0:13:40.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn! We can't get out!Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.06,0:13:43.28,Main,,0,0,0,,What's that?Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.60,0:13:46.74,Main,,0,0,0,,That's one of Doffy's abilities, I suppose.Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.58,0:13:51.18,Main,,0,0,0,,I've never seen it before, but there's one thing I know.Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.08,0:13:53.85,Main,,0,0,0,,We have nowhere to run.Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.96,0:14:02.28,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Using Parasite String in the cage, huh...Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.80,0:14:07.03,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Yeah, this is like hell...Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.70,0:14:19.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Cora-san, what's going on?Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.74,0:14:33.54,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I might be able to get Law out of here, at least.Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.18,0:14:38.28,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I have no chance to survive now, but...Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.92,0:14:42.62,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Will you remember me even after I die?Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.02,0:14:45.96,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I'll die with a smile...Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.18,0:14:57.93,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Because... if you think of me someday,Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.60,0:15:03.64,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I'd rather you remember my smile.Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.56,0:15:11.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Law, we gotta get going.Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.42,0:15:20.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's go!Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.60,0:15:29.87,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Doffy. This is our boss.Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.80,0:15:34.38,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Everyone was knocked out?!Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.88,0:15:37.73,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,That must be Haki!Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.20,0:15:40.92,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Brother, don't!Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.92,0:15:43.02,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Brother!Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.70,0:15:48.69,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Why did you take my power away?!Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.04,0:15:55.73,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Do you want me to give you... the strength to take revenge?Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.00,0:16:00.10,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,We can't undo what you've done now!Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.22,0:16:04.84,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I'm going back to the Holy Land by taking your head!Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.46,0:16:14.35,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Doflamingo. Rosinante.Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.58,0:16:18.53,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry that you had to have...Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.14,0:16:21.42,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,a father like me.Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.78,0:16:56.19,Main,,0,0,0,,No! Don't do it!Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.92,0:17:00.20,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't know what's going on!Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.88,0:17:04.97,Main,,0,0,0,,The town was suddenly surrounded by some sort of giant cage!Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.97,0:17:06.50,Main,,0,0,0,,We can't get in!Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.84,0:17:11.68,Main,,0,0,0,,And this might be hard to believe, but inside, the pirates had a falling outDialogue: 0,0:17:11.68,0:17:13.38,Main,,0,0,0,,and are slaughtering each other!Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.65,0:17:15.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Dray!Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.34,0:17:18.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Where are you going? Help me!Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.62,0:17:20.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Can't you do something about the cage?!Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.62,0:17:22.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! Don't go!Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.22,0:17:27.98,Captions,,0,0,330,,Hideout of the Barrels PiratesDialogue: 0,0:17:28.44,0:17:30.42,Main,,0,0,0,,It's the Donquixote Family!Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.72,0:17:33.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Dray!Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.12,0:17:35.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn! Where did that brat go?!Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.28,0:17:38.95,Main,,0,0,0,,He's never here when I really need him!Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.88,0:17:44.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Despite being our strongest fighter, he's a spineless wimp!Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.69,0:17:56.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Doflamingo!Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.49,0:17:59.94,Main,,0,0,0,,It was you guys who stole the Operation Fruit, wasn't it?!Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.38,0:18:03.30,Main,,0,0,0,,If we did, I wouldn't have to go through all this!Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.68,0:18:08.06,Main,,0,0,0,,How dare you let it be stolen, you drunken idiot!Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.30,0:18:15.08,Main,,0,0,0,,This is a treasure hoard-in!Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.08,0:18:19.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, carry this loot out carefully!Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.04,0:18:21.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Awesome-in!Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.10,0:18:27.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Not bad, not bad! They've got a ton!Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.03,0:18:31.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop fooling around! Look for Corazón!Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.54,0:18:33.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Buffalo!Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.22,0:18:35.86,Main,,0,0,0,,How's your search from up there?!Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.02,0:18:43.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Nobody could survive in this burning wasteland-dasuyan!Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.60,0:18:47.53,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm picking up a message!Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.53,0:18:49.62,Main,,0,0,0,,We took a boy into protective custody at the coast.Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.98,0:18:52.58,Main,,0,0,0,,We're still searching for other victims.Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.88,0:18:56.65,Main,,0,0,0,,They said the Navy took someone into protective custody!Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.05,0:19:04.18,Main,,0,0,0,,You!Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.18,0:19:05.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Doffy!Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.66,0:19:07.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Sounds like they found Corazón!Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.44,0:19:11.94,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Law. This is a blind spot for the pirates.Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.68,0:19:14.87,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,They'll never find you. Stay still!Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.02,0:19:18.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Corazón went this way!Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.52,0:19:21.08,Main,,0,0,0,,This way, Lao G!Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.08,0:19:27.12,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,What? I can't open it!Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.48,0:19:28.91,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Something is on it!Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.91,0:19:30.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Got it!Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.34,0:19:47.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Ouch...Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.78,0:19:55.86,Main,,0,0,0,,You lowlife!Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.86,0:19:57.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Why have you been pretending that you can't talk?!Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.10,0:20:05.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Because you and I... have nothing to talk about.Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.97,0:20:07.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Screw you!Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.88,0:20:10.02,Main,,0,0,0,,You've made a fool of the young master!Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.13,0:20:13.22,Main,,0,0,0,,That's enough, Gladius!Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.86,0:20:16.19,Main,,0,0,0,,He'll die before the young master gets here.Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.30,0:20:21.30,Main,,0,0,0,,It's no problem!Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.30,0:20:26.76,Main,,0,0,0,,He was trying to force an all-out war between us and the Navy today!Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.48,0:20:31.08,Main,,0,0,0,,What a sinful bastard!Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.35,0:20:41.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! The young master's here!Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.88,0:20:53.90,Main,,0,0,0,,It's been six months...Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.86,0:20:56.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Corazón.Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.08,0:21:27.64,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,You have no place to go?Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.57,0:21:32.40,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Then, do you wanna come with me?Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.15,0:21:47.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Marine Code 01746.Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.26,0:21:52.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Commander Rosinante of Navy HQ.Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.66,0:21:58.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Donquixote Family, captain, Doflamingo.Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.70,0:22:05.32,Main,,0,0,0,,I have been undercover to prevent a future tragedy of your doing.Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.40,0:22:08.37,Main,,0,0,0,,I am a marine!Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.44,0:22:17.94,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry that I lied to you...Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.68,0:22:22.48,Main,,0,0,0,,I lied because I didn't want you to hate me.Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.48,0:22:27.59,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Why are you bringing it up now?!Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.14,0:22:29.40,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I...Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.40,0:22:32.26,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,already knew that!Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.03,0:22:38.30,Main,,0,0,0,,You fool! Do you think it'll help you to apologize now?!Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.30,0:22:41.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop telling those insipid jokes and...Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.10,0:22:44.28,Main,,0,0,0,,answer these two questions!Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.82,0:22:47.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Where's the Operation Fruit?! Where's Law?!Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.06,0:22:52.52,Main,,0,0,0,,The Operation Fruit... I let Law eat it!Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.88,0:22:56.12,Main,,0,0,0,,He's a Devil Fruit user now!Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.92,0:23:00.02,Main,,0,0,0,,He managed to get out of the cage.Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.02,0:23:05.20,Main,,0,0,0,,I bet he's been taken into protective custody by a scout ship from Navy HQ by now.Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.20,0:23:07.16,Main,,0,0,0,,You can't touch him now!Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.16,0:23:08.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Young master!Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.06,0:23:13.44,Main,,0,0,0,,We heard the Navy say on the radio earlier they took a boy under their care!Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.61,0:23:16.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you report that sooner?!Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.57,0:23:19.06,Main,,0,0,0,,I promise, I rushed all the way here-dasuyan!Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.06,0:23:20.44,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.91,0:23:22.12,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,A boy?Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.60,0:23:25.22,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,What a strange coincidence!Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.97,0:23:27.64,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Law is here!Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.62,0:23:33.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Check into that quickly! I'll undo the bird cage!Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.92,0:23:37.74,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,As I thought, Law, something wills you to stay alive.Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.12,0:23:42.33,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Saviors keep descending upon you one after another.Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.74,0:23:44.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Prepare to set sail!Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.85,0:23:48.20,Main,,0,0,0,,If what he said was true, we'll sink the Navy's scout ship...Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.52,0:23:50.23,Main,,0,0,0,,and take Law back!Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.24,0:23:51.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't.Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.92,0:23:54.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Why would you wanna go after Law?Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.52,0:23:58.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Why would I wanna go after Law?Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.66,0:24:01.49,Main,,0,0,0,,If he ate the Operation Fruit...Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.49,0:24:07.56,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll need to educate him so that he can die for me one day!Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.90,0:24:12.66,Main,,0,0,0,,I swear... Everything you've done was so uncalled for!Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.26,0:24:15.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Why do you wanna get in my way?!Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.67,0:24:20.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Why do I have to kill another member of my biological family?!Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.21,0:24:24.64,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Cora-san, are you sure you'll be alright?!Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.38,0:24:30.30,Main,,0,0,0,,I know you can't shoot me...Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.20,0:24:34.08,Main,,0,0,0,,You're too much like our father!Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.08,0:24:36.09,Main,,0,0,0,,You told me you'll be alright, didn't you?!Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.09,0:24:37.15,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Listen, Law.Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.92,0:24:43.64,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Pirates can't resist taking treasure chests to their ships whenever they find them.Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.80,0:24:50.06,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,That means if you stay in here, you'll definitely have a chance to get out of the cage.Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.06,0:24:51.26,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Don't miss it.Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.66,0:24:52.37,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,And you, Cora-san?!Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.56,0:24:56.06,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,You silly...Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.06,0:24:59.74,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Doffy wants you and the Operation power.Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.36,0:25:02.64,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Doffy and I are brothers by blood.Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.32,0:25:08.06,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Of course, he'd get pissed at me, but I'm sure he won't kill me.Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.92,0:25:10.00,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Calm.Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.82,0:25:17.49,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,This technique mutes the sound of anything you interact with.Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.49,0:25:20.03,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Alright, see you in the next town.Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.76,0:25:21.87,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Hey, Law.Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.56,0:25:26.10,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I love you!Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.02,0:25:35.16,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,This isn't what you told me, Cora-san!Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.58,0:25:37.88,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,You said he wouldn't kill you, didn't you?!Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.86,0:25:45.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Law won't obey you... Doffy!Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.49,0:25:47.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Affected by White Lead Disease,Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.19,0:25:51.57,Main,,0,0,0,,he was doomed to die in three years.Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.38,0:25:54.63,Main,,0,0,0,,But he won over that disease.Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.62,0:25:58.37,Main,,0,0,0,,He's not the same Law...Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.98,0:26:03.34,Main,,0,0,0,,who lost his way and came to visit a crazy pirate that day.Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.34,0:26:10.00,Main,,0,0,0,,There is nothing he can gain from you, a veritable child of destruction!Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.00,0:26:11.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Leave him alone!Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.32,0:26:14.76,Main,,0,0,0,,He's free!Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.94,0:26:35.34,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Say it again! Who did you call a monster?!Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.68,0:26:38.84,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Whoa! He tripped and caught fire at the same time!Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.38,0:26:41.21,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,See? You had a quiet sleep, didn't you?!Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.21,0:26:42.46,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Shut up already!Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.40,0:27:21.45,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Not yet...Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.63,0:27:25.06,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna stay alive a little longer...Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.06,0:27:26.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Pull the ship over here!Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.72,0:27:29.18,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Because if I die now...Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.56,0:27:35.02,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,the spell I cast on you will be broken instantly...Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.86,0:27:39.04,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Your voice, and any noise you make...Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.44,0:27:41.94,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,will echo across the island.Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.44,0:27:45.10,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Go, Law...Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.64,0:27:49.51,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,quietly... without being noticed...Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.20,0:27:52.72,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,far, far away...Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.78,0:27:56.45,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,There is nothing to bind you down anymore...Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.68,0:28:00.06,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,whether it's the iron border of the White Town...Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.58,0:28:02.24,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,or a terminal illness...Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.08,0:28:05.43,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Nothing and no one will limit you.Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.38,0:28:11.40,Main,,0,0,0,,It's Tsuru's warship! Dammit!Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.86,0:28:19.14,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,You are...Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.88,0:28:22.15,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,free.Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.00,0:28:31.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Fire!Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.51,0:28:58.00,OP11 Credits,,0,0,0,,Editing: Galaxy 9000  Timing: Datenshi Sewil (Opening)  QC: Mr. Luffy  Soundtracking: Halee  TC/Infoboxes: Datenshi  Original Translation: Yibis